-- U8: port the static Board Room templates into the templates table (R12).
-- Rows land published, author_user_id null (seed rows), author names and
-- is_sample preserved from templates.json. Payloads are compact UTF-8 JSON,
-- byte-identical to JSON.stringify of the static files. Idempotent: slug
-- conflicts skip, so reseeding never duplicates or touches moderated rows.

on conflict (slug) do nothing;
